-- src:8789 | (2) If the nominee, having been called on to pay any amount for the purposes of paying up, or paying any premium on, the shares, fails to pay that amount within 21 days from being called on to do so, then—
-- src:8790 | (a) in the case of shares that he agreed to take as subscriber to the memorandum, the other subscribers to the memorandum, and
-- src:8791 | (b) in any other case, the directors of the company when the shares were issued to or acquired by him,
-- src:8792 | are jointly and severally liable with him to pay that amount.
@ref s 661(2) Joint and several liability of the other subscribers or the directors (src:8789-8792)
GIVEN held IS A `s 660(1) shares held by a nominee`
      who IS A `s 661(2) who is asked to pay`
      `the date the nominee was called on to pay` IS A DATE
      `the date the nominee paid the amount, if he has` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date as of which the question is asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 661(2) the person is jointly and severally liable with the nominee to pay the amount` MEANS
    IF (`s 661(1) this section applies to the shares` held) EQUALS JUST FALSE
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies where shares in a limited company—"
    ELSE IF `the date as of which the question is asked` AT MOST (`the date the nominee was called on to pay` PLUS 21)
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "fails to pay that amount within 21 days from being called on to do so, then"
         ELSE CONSIDER `the date the nominee paid the amount, if he has`
              WHEN JUST paid THEN
                   IF paid AT MOST (`the date the nominee was called on to pay` PLUS 21)
                   THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "fails to pay that amount within 21 days from being called on to do so, then"
                   ELSE `s 661(2) who is liable` held who
              WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 661(2) who is liable` held who
    WHERE
        `s 661(2) who is liable` held2 who2 MEANS
            CONSIDER who2
            WHEN `s 661(2)(a) another subscriber to the memorandum` THEN
                 CONSIDER held2's `s 660(1) how the shares come to the nominee`
                 WHEN `s 660(1)(a) taken by a subscriber to the memorandum as nominee of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
                 OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(a) in the case of shares that he agreed to take as subscriber to the memorandum, the other subscribers to the memorandum"
            WHEN `s 661(2)(b) a director of the company when the shares were issued to or acquired by the nominee` THEN
                 CONSIDER held2's `s 660(1) how the shares come to the nominee`
                 WHEN `s 660(1)(a) taken by a subscriber to the memorandum as nominee of the company` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(b) in any other case, the directors of the company when the shares were issued to or acquired by him"
                 OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
            OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text names the other subscribers and the directors

